OL,3,GNEWSAMan held on suspicion of murder
OL,4,Aover fatal attack
OL,5,
OL,6,FA further arrest has been made by
OL,7,Fpolice investigating a fatal assault on
OL,8,Fa man in Leeds.
OL,10,FRaheim Jackson, known as Reema, was
OL,11,Fattacked by a group of men armed with
OL,12,Fweapons on Hedley Chase, New Wortley,
OL,13,Fon Saturday 24 October, according to
OL,14,FWest Yorkshire Police.
OL,16,FA man, 39, had been arrested on
OL,17,Fsuspicion of Jackson's murder and
OL,18,Fremained in police custody, a force
OL,19,Fspokesperson said. Meanwhile, another
OL,20,Fman, 26, who was arrested on Sunday on
OL,21,Fsuspicion of murder, had been released
OL,22,Funder investigation, they added.
OL,23,APub: 04-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
