OL,3,GNEWSAMan held on suspicion of murder
OL,4,Aover fatal attack
OL,5,
OL,6,FPolice previously said Michael Gyedu,
OL,7,Falso 26, of Rathmell Road, Leeds, had
OL,8,Fbeen charged with Jackson's murder
OL,9,Fafter being arrested in London on 30
OL,10,FOctober and was due to appear in court.
